# Firebase project configuration is environment-specific (project id, api key, client ids). It is not
# a secret, but it differs per Firebase project, so it is supplied locally or by CI instead of being
# committed. The Gradle plugin is applied only when app/google-services.json exists.
google-services.json
**/google-services.json
# A Firebase Admin service-account key is privileged. It must never be committed, and it is never
# used by the Android app: only server-side tooling may read it.
*service-account*.json
*adminsdk*.json
